{{ define "title" }}Home - Nikola's Blog{{ end }}

{{ define "content" }}
<p>Welcome to my blog. This is where I share my thoughts on Go and teaching.</p>

<button 
    hx-get="/load-snippet" 
    hx-target="#snippet" 
    hx-swap="innerHTML">
    Load something via HTMX
</button>

<div id="snippet"></div>
{{ end }}
